        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo, was soomjeanda ASEETA ea dea Ng'utamiida was Yesu Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeda eemoojiga atamaniyeenya dardaawaat: Seayu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Masaweega ea weaghuumeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anung' ghoah haleanjeeda sean hooseaneega, fuga eaduupcheewi, aba iisisimsimeegwa aba gilakil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghoanali gideaba simooda masaweegeagwa gaygwanyakneegwa milikghteayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea alooheeda gagasa gweadu gadiyeeda majeek nea goowooschi, hidaat nea mwashoadeeweegwa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi siida wassean mida jeedeang'wa iisuunyeewa weaghuumeeda, ea damwaash ASEETA, adawi buuneesean haleanjeeda aba inyeanda jeeda, nea maygwareekusa ak gajeataw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gagasa gamus aba masaweega, nea mamwachmwaja gil, aba gideaba siida machmajiischi gawuurji laweachkweeda basooda aat jeameeda nea geeyuuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7,8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:7,8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7,8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida machmajiischi, nea mabwagi nea moapta ng'eanyi aba jeeda naweadingaaschi sean, adaghwarar gideaba gayghwanyas gil aba heeda Ng'utamiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.7+JAS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.7",
              "JAS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barbaranda ea baruureega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.7+JAS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.7",
              "JAS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anung'waada orjeeda giyeanya mwanang' ghaghwar geaw aba jeeda hooseaneagaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea meanang'oocheanda ea siihiing'u, aba gideaba gawuurji deakghweeda seenga gayghang'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseeta iissa goorearu nea gweadu beasta, ak ghoaghajaam seenga; ak ghoabit deakghweadaanyi, ak goosha alooheeda. Gwasunu eara meanang'oocheanda gayghaghajaamiit aba naweadingaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simsimda ea galaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wanaweagaaschi siida riyeang'da iisimsim, aba gideaba iing'ata nea nijoar simsimda gayghwanyas shiipka eaweega mamuudeana ghayi bay gwaheeleesa ASEETA fugiga bwariiy ninyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adagwayi siida iisisimsim, “Aniini gwasimsiman ASEETA”; aba gideaba ASEETA moamu gwasimsim gidamuy ak eara niny ea maygwasimsim siida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean giliwas sih iissa geesimsim damanda sigassa nea geaghurghur aba gidida gasean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gidida gasa siidean iigweayiit gweadu riing'eeda; ama iidu nea nirir riing'eedida gweadu miyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adeereenganeegwa, fuga eaduupcheewi aabwariinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilinyoo eahaakta miy ea gilinyoo eatayda hidaat gwaleabu heetiyeada, ak ghwararang'aana heeda Bwaabwa weeshinda nea headaanyi ea manda yamoodeaba geaw ghana jirooneeda yamiteaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gidabwariiyda niny gwajiileasa aseasa aba ng'asheanda huumwa ak geewuurjeewi haghweega madeeda aba jeeda haleanjeadaanyi ghayi sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iing'da ea sinooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoanali ng'asheesu, fuga eaduupcheewi aabwariinyi. Asi daba siisi wassean lamajeesa iing'da ng'asheanda, nea goojiileesa baloolda, ak ea mii asas nyaras, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nyarasta siida maygwasin doobiiwnata ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi oosheagiidana geat ririnnyeanda ea gasooda hawunda muy ak ghoang'waanyi aba garbabanda ng'asheandida, ammu gwaleabu gurooruunatkeagwean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gagasa ahuwa fuga sina ng'asheanda, adoobeacheewi iing'da ak ghwahit, nea gooreenganayi geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iibeachi iing'da ng'asheanda ak ghwahit, nea ghanyea masina, siisi abeeda gawuurji siida ng'ula gheamamdaanyi aba jeeda giyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gang'ula geaw amang'ata gawa heechea gawa ama deagheata ea niroosa giduurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida ng'ula deaweedeeda hidaat, jea gweadu giibaldeaba geaw, ak ghwashng'u, adaghoah siida iing'shi ramasoot gagasa ea siida sina gadiyeeda gil, siisi aba sinoadaanyi bea gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
